# Conditional Statements Assignment - C++

This repository contains C++ programming exercises on different types of **Conditional Statements**.

## Contents

| File                    | Topic                  | Exercises |
|-------------------------|------------------------|-----------|
| `if-statement.docx`     | Simple If Statement    | 7         |
| `if-else.docx`          | If-Else Statement      | 7         |
| `if-else-if.docx`       | If-Else-If Ladder      | 7         |
| `nested-if.docx`        | Nested If              | 7         |
| `switch.docx`           | Switch Statement       | 7         |
| `nested-switch.docx`    | Nested Switch          | 7         |

## How to Use

1. Download any `.docx` file.
2. Open it in Microsoft Word or Google Docs.
3. Each document contains the problem statement and complete C++ code for 7 exercises.

## Topics Covered

- If Statement
- If-Else Statement
- If-Else-If Ladder
- Nested If
- Switch Statement
- Nested Switch
